<p>When I tried to create a follower based on the other <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Follower%20tutorial" title="Follower tutorial">Follower_tutorial</a>, I had a bit of trouble following along. Most of it was understandable, but the scripts were kind of scattered, duplicated, confusing, and generally not designed for extensions to the single player campaign. So I made a more noob-friendly follower tutorial that extends the single player campaign. Since the other follower tutorial goes into more detail than I do about steps 1, 3, 4, and 11, you may want to look there when you're at those steps. 
</p><p>This is a work-in-progress. The formatting clearly needs some work. If you find something amiss, PM me on Bioware (screen name = satans_karma) or edit it here. 
</p><p><br />
</p>
